    "id": "275cc89d-b219-4c85-a2dc-d76b4f1611bd",
    "title": "退伍军人如何安置？",
    "folderId": "497cc6e4-ce9e-4fa7-9361-f5597b8c41fa",
    "createdAt": "2026-04-16T23:38:33.253409",
    "updatedAt": "2026-04-16T23:38:54.651247",
